      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riverdale%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Nomadic Shoshone, Ute, and prehistoric Indians hunted and fished in the Riverdale area for centuries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
