      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.riverdaleutah.gov/community/about_riverdale.php"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Riverdale grew as an outgrowth of Ogden and took its name from its proximity to the Weber River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
